The checked-in dict_pinyin.txt.gz is a deterministic transformation of
src/data/rawdict_utf16_65105_freq.txt filtered with src/data/valid_utf16.txt by
the pure-Go st-go/googlepinyin builder. Normal builds do not download, unpack,
or compile the upstream source. The portable format, runtime parser,
segmentation, ranking, and asynchronous worker are separate Go code outside
upstream.

